    "title": "Jemima \"Ann\" Sutton, age 84 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Jemima \"Ann\" Sutton, age 84, went to be with Jesus on Sunday, September 14, 2025. Born January 7, 1941, in Pryor, OK, Ann was the oldest child of the late Samuel Robert Sullivan and Edna Mayme Sullivan. In addition to her parents, she was preceded in death by her brother, Jerry Robert Sullivan. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
